msgid ""
"Add the :opcode:`!END_SEND` instruction. (Contributed by Mark Shannon "
"in :gh:`103082`.)"
msgstr ""
"افزودن دستورالعمل :opcode:`!END_SEND`. (مشارکت‌شده توسط Mark Shannon "
