msgid ""
"Add "
"the :opcode:`LOAD_FROM_DICT_OR_DEREF`, :opcode:`LOAD_FROM_DICT_OR_GLOBALS`, "
"and :opcode:`LOAD_LOCALS` opcodes as part of the implementation "
"of :pep:`695`. Remove the :opcode:`!LOAD_CLASSDEREF` opcode, which can be "
"replaced with :opcode:`LOAD_LOCALS` plus :opcode:`LOAD_FROM_DICT_OR_DEREF`. "
"(Contributed by Jelle Zijlstra in :gh:`103764`.)"
msgstr ""
"کدعمل‌های :opcode:`LOAD_FROM_DICT_OR_DEREF`، :opcode:`LOAD_FROM_DICT_OR_GLOBALS` "
"و :opcode:`LOAD_LOCALS` به‌عنوان بخشی از پیاده‌سازی :pep:`695` افزوده شدند. "
"کدعمل :opcode:`!LOAD_CLASSDEREF` که می‌توان آن را با :opcode:`LOAD_LOCALS` "
"به‌علاوه‌ی :opcode:`LOAD_FROM_DICT_OR_DEREF` جایگزین کرد، حذف شد. (با مشارکت "
"Jelle Zijlstra در :gh:`103764`.)"

msgid ""
